  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  name: xstar-tools\n  version: \"0.6.89.5\"\n  sha256: \"961b66b0ce0b3bc966a6322a3bef05e65879e1f09d50e8d4b9527030ad7a91b2\"\n\npackage:\n  name: ${{ name }}\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://pypi.org/packages/source/x/xstar-tools/xstar_tools-${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: ${{ sha256 }}\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  skip: win\n  script: build.sh\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - make\n    - pkg-config\n  host:\n    - python\n    - pip\n    - setuptools >=77\n    - wheel\n    - cfitsio\n  run:\n    - python\n    - cfitsio\n    - if: match(python, \"<3.11\")\n      then:\n        - numpy >=1.23,<2.4\n        - astropy-base >=5.0\n      else:\n        - numpy >=1.24\n        - astropy-base >=7.2\n\ntests:\n  - python:\n      imports:\n        - xstar_tools\n      pip_check: true\n  - script:\n      - xstar-tools version\n      - xstar-cpp --version\n      - xstar-cpp --abi\n      - xstar-xspec --version\n      - xstar-tools doctor --require zone-cpp --json\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://github.com/xstar-tools/xstar-tools\n  repository: https://github.com/xstar-tools/xstar-tools\n  documentation: https://github.com/xstar-tools/xstar-tools/tree/main/docs\n  license: GPL-3.0-only\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  summary: Source-faithful Python/C++ XSTAR tools, atomic-data utilities, and runtime\n  description: |\n    xstar-tools provides source-faithful Python/C++ XSTAR tools and the native\n    non-MPI XSTAR runtime. The canonical scientific oracle remains FORTRAN\n    XSTAR 2.59g. Atomic data file atdb.fits remains external and is discovered\n    through the documented XSTAR data-path contract.\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - danehkar\n",
